WEBVTT

00:00:02.530 --> 00:00:04.720
Sophie-chan, it's nighttime.

00:00:05.110 --> 00:00:07.220
Get up so we can eat together.

00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:13.070
It's already that late?

00:00:13.070 --> 00:00:16.700
I'll go prepare things, so get up, okay?

00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:19.220
I'm already up.

00:00:20.030 --> 00:00:25.510
Hmm... Today I need to order blood, and then...

00:00:26.630 --> 00:00:28.010
It's done!

00:00:28.010 --> 00:00:30.340
I hope Sophie-chan will come soon.

00:00:30.340 --> 00:00:31.800
<b>Several Minutes Later...</b>

00:00:32.970 --> 00:00:36.560
Sophie-chan, it's ready—wha?!

00:00:36.560 --> 00:00:37.970
She's asleep again!

00:00:39.170 --> 00:00:41.010
And she's stuck?!

00:02:11.020 --> 00:02:15.480
<b>Episode 9</b>

00:02:11.520 --> 00:02:15.480
<b>Vampire VS Vampire Hunter</b>

00:02:19.890 --> 00:02:22.010
Did you just get home?

00:02:22.010 --> 00:02:23.580
It's quite late.

00:02:23.580 --> 00:02:25.860
Yes, we were getting ready 
for the cultural festival.

00:02:25.860 --> 00:02:27.720
Oh, the cultural festival!

00:02:27.720 --> 00:02:30.150
You see that a lot in anime and manga!

00:02:30.150 --> 00:02:32.370
So it really does exist.

00:02:32.370 --> 00:02:36.580
It would be fun if you and Ellie-chan 
could walk around with us...

00:02:36.580 --> 00:02:39.570
But it would difficult since 
it's a daytime event.

00:02:41.080 --> 00:02:42.240
It's not a problem!

00:02:42.240 --> 00:02:44.710
I'll go even if an arm or two turns to dust!

00:02:44.710 --> 00:02:46.390
Please don't turn to dust!

00:02:46.390 --> 00:02:50.810
<b>Day of the Cultural Festival</b>

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:51.910
We have our parasols and my capes,
 and it's not far, so we should be fine.

00:02:51.910 --> 00:02:54.640
Oh, you should never let 
your guard down, Sophie.

00:02:56.500 --> 00:02:57.880
A big bug!

00:02:57.880 --> 00:02:59.160
Watch out, Sophie!

00:03:05.600 --> 00:03:06.780
Ellie!

00:03:07.240 --> 00:03:11.960
We've had our ups and downs,
 but it was fun...

00:03:12.380 --> 00:03:15.980
Ellie! Snap out of it, Ellie!

00:03:15.040 --> 00:03:17.250
<b>Vampires are super duper
 weak during the day</b>

00:03:17.250 --> 00:03:19.720
<b>Information</b>

00:03:17.700 --> 00:03:19.710
Oh, that looks good!

00:03:23.050 --> 00:03:25.300
We made it somehow.

00:03:25.660 --> 00:03:27.680
W-We did.

00:03:27.680 --> 00:03:29.730
So, where to next?

00:03:29.730 --> 00:03:32.140
Let's go check out the theater club.

00:03:32.140 --> 00:03:33.550
Yeah, that sounds good.

00:03:33.900 --> 00:03:36.920
I'm excited to see what 
they're doing this year.

00:03:36.920 --> 00:03:40.160
I know! We need to hurry if 
we want to get decent seats.

00:03:40.570 --> 00:03:42.650
So many young girls!

00:03:42.650 --> 00:03:44.200
They look tasty!

00:03:44.800 --> 00:03:46.430
So this is a cultural festival.

00:03:46.430 --> 00:03:48.510
It looks just like the 
ones I've seen in anime.

00:03:48.450 --> 00:03:50.080
<b>They recover rather quickly</b>

00:03:58.660 --> 00:04:01.720
The sun doesn't reach 
inside the hallways, huh?

00:04:01.720 --> 00:04:04.680
I think Akari's class is 
somewhere around here.

00:04:04.680 --> 00:04:06.690
Oh, it's Sophie and Ellie.

00:04:04.680 --> 00:04:07.640
<b>Maid Café
Cookie and Drink Set
400 Yen</b>

00:04:06.690 --> 00:04:07.650
Welcome, girls.

00:04:07.640 --> 00:04:10.390
<b>Bulletin Board</b>

00:04:07.650 --> 00:04:11.340
My shift's almost over,
 so let's walk around after that.

00:04:11.340 --> 00:04:14.310
What's wrong with you two?

00:04:14.310 --> 00:04:15.480
Hinata...

00:04:15.480 --> 00:04:16.800
Wh-What?

00:04:17.240 --> 00:04:19.050
Can I take a picture of you like that?

00:04:19.050 --> 00:04:20.540
I want one, too.

00:04:20.540 --> 00:04:22.770
Stop it! This is pretty embarrassing, okay?!

00:04:24.500 --> 00:04:28.590
Akari is on duty over at her club,
 so let's go see her.

00:04:28.590 --> 00:04:31.280
She's in a club? What kind?

00:04:31.280 --> 00:04:33.990
You'll see when we get there. 
She's only a phantom member, though.

00:04:34.770 --> 00:04:36.250
A phantom member?

00:04:36.920 --> 00:04:40.880
Sophie-chan... welcome...

00:04:42.610 --> 00:04:44.590
Is something wrong, Sophie?

00:04:44.590 --> 00:04:48.510
<b>Welcome to the
Handicrafts Club</b>

00:04:45.880 --> 00:04:47.880
No, that's not what I meant.

00:04:47.880 --> 00:04:50.060
You get scared so easily, Sophie.

00:04:50.840 --> 00:04:52.820
Akari, we came to visit you.

00:04:52.820 --> 00:04:55.760
Oh, you guys all came!

00:04:55.760 --> 00:04:57.360
Take your time and look around.

00:04:57.360 --> 00:05:00.200
I put in a lot of effort to get 
everything ready for today.

00:05:01.300 --> 00:05:04.720
I knew it. It <i>is</i> a haunted house.

00:05:04.720 --> 00:05:07.680
It's an exhibition of handmade 
dresses for the dolls.

00:05:07.680 --> 00:05:11.010
<i>I'm sorry, Sophie. I was 
a little scared, too.</i>

00:05:11.370 --> 00:05:13.850
It's what the handicrafts club put together.

00:05:13.850 --> 00:05:15.820
Aren't the candles romantic?

00:05:15.820 --> 00:05:18.860
Look, Mom, the dresses are so pretty!

00:05:18.860 --> 00:05:20.370
That's so cute!

00:05:20.370 --> 00:05:23.540
This stuff is surprisingly 
popular with little girls.

00:05:23.540 --> 00:05:24.750
I see.

00:05:24.750 --> 00:05:27.520
My shift's almost over, 
so hang tight for a bit, okay?

00:05:27.520 --> 00:05:28.290
Sure.

00:05:28.290 --> 00:05:32.440
Well done, Akari. All of these show 
that you have a pretty good sense of style.

00:05:33.510 --> 00:05:34.850
Thanks, Ellie-chan.

00:05:34.850 --> 00:05:36.990
<i>It's getting pretty crowded.</i>

00:05:36.990 --> 00:05:39.970
<i>I'll just sit quietly in the corner
so I'm not in the way.</i>

00:05:39.970 --> 00:05:42.550
Wow, this doll is so pretty!

00:05:42.550 --> 00:05:45.380
Oh, you're right. She's so well-made.

00:05:45.380 --> 00:05:47.630
Mom, take a picture!

00:05:47.630 --> 00:05:48.760
Good idea.

00:05:50.160 --> 00:05:51.820
Oh, I fell asleep.

00:05:52.300 --> 00:05:53.180
She moved!

00:05:53.180 --> 00:05:54.370
She talked!

00:05:54.370 --> 00:05:55.580
What?

00:05:56.140 --> 00:05:59.740
Hey, Akari, is there anything 
else fun going on?

00:05:59.740 --> 00:06:02.530
Oh, Sakuya-chan's live event 
should be on right about now.

00:06:03.420 --> 00:06:05.310
I wonder if we can still make it in time.

00:06:05.310 --> 00:06:07.010
Wow, a live event.

00:06:08.440 --> 00:06:12.390
You brush it off with heart and soul,

00:06:12.390 --> 00:06:13.880
you brush and brush,

00:06:13.880 --> 00:06:16.900
but the handprint won't go away.

00:06:17.350 --> 00:06:19.340
When you take a closer look, you realize

00:06:19.340 --> 00:06:21.600
and turn pale.

00:06:21.600 --> 00:06:26.240
It was actually on the inside of the window.

00:06:25.320 --> 00:06:29.070
<b>Live
Ghost
Stories</b>

00:06:25.330 --> 00:06:27.170
No, I can't!

00:06:27.170 --> 00:06:29.070
Nope, nope, nope!

00:06:29.950 --> 00:06:32.270
Aw, everyone's leaving.

00:06:32.270 --> 00:06:36.850
Were my live ghost stories so boring?

00:06:36.850 --> 00:06:40.140
It's fine! Your stories 
definitely touched everyone.

00:06:40.140 --> 00:06:41.220
Good work!

00:06:41.220 --> 00:06:43.250
I'm glad we didn't make it in time.

00:06:43.700 --> 00:06:44.960
Oh, right.

00:06:44.960 --> 00:06:48.680
Yuu is in the literary club,
so why don't you go check that out?

00:06:48.680 --> 00:06:51.540
I have to clean up the 
stuff from my event here.

00:06:51.540 --> 00:06:52.630
Okay.

00:06:52.640 --> 00:06:54.850
<b>Literary Club</b>

00:06:52.640 --> 00:06:54.850
<b>This is the Literary Club.</b>

00:06:52.640 --> 00:06:54.850
<b>We have new releases!!
 Please feel free to inquire within.</b>

00:06:53.690 --> 00:06:54.850
Heya.

00:06:54.850 --> 00:06:57.300
Oh, you all came.

00:06:57.300 --> 00:06:59.160
Sophie-san, long time no see.

00:06:59.160 --> 00:07:00.700
What are you doing today?

00:07:00.690 --> 00:07:05.070
<b>Sunset Time</b>

00:07:00.690 --> 00:07:05.070
<b>Sumireno High School 
Literary Club</b>

00:07:00.700 --> 00:07:02.540
I'm passing out the club journal.

00:07:02.540 --> 00:07:05.060
I've written some short 
stories and poems, too.

00:07:05.060 --> 00:07:07.130
Really? I wanna see, I wanna see!

00:07:09.200 --> 00:07:11.850
I feel pretty good about this one, actually.

00:07:12.370 --> 00:07:14.780
If you don't mind, I'd like 
to hear what you thi—

00:07:14.780 --> 00:07:17.600
Actually, no! It's too embarrassing!

00:07:17.600 --> 00:07:19.250
After all the trouble of
putting it in a book?!

00:07:19.250 --> 00:07:19.870
<b>HAUN</b>

00:07:19.870 --> 00:07:20.500
<b>TED</b>

00:07:20.500 --> 00:07:21.460
<b>HOUSE</b>

00:07:22.080 --> 00:07:24.590
<i>Why is everything like this today?!</i>

00:07:24.590 --> 00:07:26.710
Let's all go in.

00:07:26.710 --> 00:07:27.330
<i>I knew it!</i>

00:07:27.330 --> 00:07:30.310
Welcome. Four visitors now enteri—

00:07:30.310 --> 00:07:31.750
I'll pass. It's too scary.

00:07:31.750 --> 00:07:34.540
Then I'll wait outside with Sophie-chan.

00:07:34.540 --> 00:07:36.140
Oh, I'll wait, too.

00:07:36.140 --> 00:07:38.610
Oh, Hinata, you're scared 
of things like this, too?

00:07:39.310 --> 00:07:40.530
Really?

00:07:40.530 --> 00:07:42.390
It's not really that—

00:07:42.390 --> 00:07:43.960
Okay, then, let's go.

00:07:44.900 --> 00:07:47.110
<b>Scared, but acts tough</b>

00:07:45.410 --> 00:07:47.100
Have fun.

00:07:50.080 --> 00:07:53.710
Ellie, if you're scared, 
you can hold my hand.

00:07:53.710 --> 00:07:56.570
Oh, so this is what it 
looks like on the inside.

00:07:56.570 --> 00:07:58.700
Hey, don't keep going without me!

00:08:00.690 --> 00:08:03.280
It's so dark and quiet.

00:08:04.930 --> 00:08:06.120
Phew.

00:08:06.120 --> 00:08:07.910
It's kinda calming.

00:08:07.910 --> 00:08:10.260
Maybe it's the familiar atmosphere.

00:08:10.260 --> 00:08:12.330
Don't get all comfortable there!

00:08:12.330 --> 00:08:15.260
Um, could you please not...

00:08:15.260 --> 00:08:17.620
Well, I guess Ellie is a 
monster of sorts, too.

00:08:17.620 --> 00:08:19.610
Oh, it's Sophie-chan.

00:08:20.070 --> 00:08:21.240
Yamada...

00:08:21.240 --> 00:08:24.490
Thank you for sitting in class 
for me that other time.

00:08:24.490 --> 00:08:27.120
You're here with your sister today?

00:08:27.120 --> 00:08:28.050
You look so alike.

00:08:28.050 --> 00:08:28.770
Yeah!

00:08:28.770 --> 00:08:32.700
She's such a cute little sister,
clinging to me all the time.

00:08:32.700 --> 00:08:35.850
We get along so well, don't we?

00:08:36.530 --> 00:08:38.460
M-My Sophie-chan's the same!

00:08:38.460 --> 00:08:40.180
We're super clingy with each other!

00:08:40.180 --> 00:08:41.240
You don't have to compete.

00:08:41.640 --> 00:08:44.770
Sophie-chan and I are really close, too.

00:08:44.770 --> 00:08:48.010
We go out together,
 brush each other's hair...

00:08:48.010 --> 00:08:53.220
Well, we still take baths together 
and sleep together at night.

00:08:53.790 --> 00:08:55.960
She's so spoiled.

00:08:55.960 --> 00:08:57.480
You're embarrassing me!

00:08:57.480 --> 00:08:58.000
Wha?!

00:08:57.510 --> 00:08:58.470
<b>Jealous</b>

00:08:58.000 --> 00:08:59.250
That's adorable.

00:08:59.250 --> 00:09:01.210
Well, we'll get going now.

00:09:01.210 --> 00:09:03.510
Bye-bye!

00:09:03.510 --> 00:09:05.110
Where do you want to go next?

00:09:05.110 --> 00:09:05.930
Um...

00:09:06.600 --> 00:09:08.570
I'm so jealous!

00:09:08.570 --> 00:09:12.590
Starting today, I want to take baths 
with you and sleep together, too!

00:09:12.590 --> 00:09:14.770
I don't take baths, and we 
sleep at different times.

00:09:14.770 --> 00:09:15.940
We're not everyone else.

00:09:19.160 --> 00:09:20.690
The yakisoba's so good!

00:09:20.690 --> 00:09:22.370
They have cotton candy over there, too.

00:09:22.370 --> 00:09:24.110
Hashtag cultural festival.

00:09:24.110 --> 00:09:26.180
That slab looks useful.

00:09:26.750 --> 00:09:29.390
I'm sorry they don't sell blood here.

00:09:29.390 --> 00:09:31.350
No, it'd be scary if they did.

00:09:31.850 --> 00:09:33.670
It's fine, though.

00:09:33.670 --> 00:09:35.960
You can just suck my blood today.

00:09:35.960 --> 00:09:39.170
We're good. I brought some for Ellie, too.

00:09:39.170 --> 00:09:41.670
I heard your blood tastes bad, so no thanks.

00:09:52.660 --> 00:09:54.200
I had fun today.

00:09:54.200 --> 00:09:56.050
Thank you for inviting me.

00:09:56.050 --> 00:10:00.430
I was glad you two were there with us.

00:10:00.430 --> 00:10:01.170
Hmm...

00:10:01.740 --> 00:10:05.270
I thought it was just a fictional 
thing they made up for manga,

00:10:05.270 --> 00:10:07.770
but the cultural festival is actually real.

00:10:07.770 --> 00:10:09.090
Of course it is.

00:10:09.090 --> 00:10:12.950
Speaking of festivals, I'd like to go 
to one of these "bloodbath" festivals.

00:10:13.370 --> 00:10:17.280
Oh, I've heard that name a lot.
I wonder where it's held.

00:10:17.280 --> 00:10:22.100
I bet it's like the tomato festival, 
where the whole city gets turned red.

00:10:22.100 --> 00:10:23.210
So wonderful!

00:10:23.210 --> 00:10:25.150
They don't have that kind of festival!

00:10:25.150 --> 00:10:26.540
Scary...

00:10:30.510 --> 00:10:33.070
It's totally the season for steamed buns.

00:10:33.070 --> 00:10:35.770
Oh, those things they have by the register.

00:10:35.770 --> 00:10:38.610
Yeah. They have all sorts of different types.

00:10:39.000 --> 00:10:41.650
I like the ones with red bean paste.
And the pizza ones.

00:10:41.650 --> 00:10:44.390
Unfortunately, they don't have blood buns.

00:10:44.390 --> 00:10:46.290
Oh, they don't?

00:10:46.290 --> 00:10:46.890
Huh?

00:10:47.330 --> 00:10:48.990
What's up, Sophie-chan?

00:10:48.990 --> 00:10:51.300
That's a bit of an unusual sight.

00:10:51.300 --> 00:10:52.620
You're right.

00:10:52.620 --> 00:10:54.560
What are they doing?

00:10:55.430 --> 00:10:56.870
Oh, they collapsed.

00:11:01.750 --> 00:11:03.130
Snap out of it!

00:11:03.130 --> 00:11:04.640
Are you okay?

00:11:04.640 --> 00:11:06.690
Should we call an ambulance?

00:11:06.680 --> 00:11:07.810
<b>Rumble</b>

00:11:14.560 --> 00:11:17.840
I'm so sorry for this.

00:11:17.840 --> 00:11:21.020
I've been walking around all day 
and haven't eaten anything.

00:11:21.380 --> 00:11:23.870
If that's not enough, I can make more.

00:11:23.870 --> 00:11:25.740
Thank you very much.

00:11:25.740 --> 00:11:28.990
What were you doing around 
here without eating anything?

00:11:28.990 --> 00:11:31.130
Wo fell he gruh I—

00:11:31.130 --> 00:11:33.330
You can finish finish eating first.

00:11:35.090 --> 00:11:36.490
My apologies.

00:11:36.490 --> 00:11:40.330
To tell the truth, I'm an 
aspiring vampire hunter.

00:11:40.330 --> 00:11:43.080
I heard that there's a vampire
 in this neighborhood,

00:11:43.080 --> 00:11:44.590
so I came to vanquish them.

00:11:45.080 --> 00:11:46.610
A vampire hunter?!

00:11:46.610 --> 00:11:49.280
Where did you hear something like that?!

00:11:49.280 --> 00:11:53.600
<i>I need to stop uploading pictures 
of the neighborhood to social media.</i>

00:11:56.260 --> 00:11:58.590
<i>I won't let her lay a finger on Sophie-chan!</i>

00:12:00.650 --> 00:12:02.480
You two are quite close.

00:12:02.480 --> 00:12:06.480
By the way, do you know 
where that vampire lives?

00:12:07.110 --> 00:12:10.190
<i>Oh, she hasn't realized yet.</i>

00:12:11.720 --> 00:12:14.030
If you've seen anything,
I'd love to hear about it.

00:12:14.030 --> 00:12:16.900
N-Nope, I've never seen anything.

00:12:16.900 --> 00:12:19.010
It must be somewhere else.

00:12:19.010 --> 00:12:20.520
I know nothing.

00:12:20.520 --> 00:12:22.140
I see.

00:12:22.140 --> 00:12:24.540
<i>We feigned ignorance so hard.</i>

00:12:26.670 --> 00:12:28.590
So it's not here, either.

00:12:28.590 --> 00:12:30.930
Don't be so down.

00:12:30.930 --> 00:12:33.320
Do you live nearby?

00:12:33.320 --> 00:12:36.180
No, I've come from far away.

00:12:36.180 --> 00:12:39.190
I was planning on staying at 
my sister's house tonight,

00:12:39.190 --> 00:12:40.950
but she happens to be out of town.

00:12:41.650 --> 00:12:43.620
Then you should stay here.

00:12:43.940 --> 00:12:45.550
Are you sure about that, Sophie?

00:12:45.550 --> 00:12:48.950
No, I couldn't. It's just one day.
I'll be fine outside.

00:12:48.950 --> 00:12:52.420
No, you can't do that!
A girl can't camp outside!

00:12:52.420 --> 00:12:54.420
Huh? A girl?

00:12:56.270 --> 00:12:58.040
It's not like I don't have any...

00:12:58.040 --> 00:13:01.040
I-I'm sorry! It's just that your 
hair is short, too, so I...

00:13:01.040 --> 00:13:03.560
But Sophie-chan, is this safe?

00:13:03.560 --> 00:13:07.320
It's fine. I just have to pretend 
to be human until morning.

00:13:07.320 --> 00:13:08.700
Sophie-san,

00:13:09.290 --> 00:13:11.320
are you from abroad?

00:13:11.320 --> 00:13:13.820
Your hair is silver, and your eyes are red.

00:13:13.820 --> 00:13:15.360
That's quite unusual.

00:13:15.360 --> 00:13:17.510
Maybe <i>you're</i> the vampire.

00:13:17.970 --> 00:13:19.990
<i>She's suspicious?!</i>

00:13:22.700 --> 00:13:24.710
I am human.

00:13:24.710 --> 00:13:27.690
Every day, I get up and 
tirelessly eat white rice.

00:13:27.690 --> 00:13:30.310
<i>A human would never say something like that!</i>

00:13:32.330 --> 00:13:33.830
That was a joke.

00:13:33.830 --> 00:13:36.470
It couldn't be this easy to find a vampire.

00:13:36.470 --> 00:13:37.420
Right.

00:13:37.420 --> 00:13:39.040
Y-You're right.

00:13:39.730 --> 00:13:43.560
Anyway, why do you want to be a 
vampire hunter in this day and age?

00:13:43.560 --> 00:13:48.380
About a hundred years ago,
my great-great-great-great-grandfather

00:13:48.380 --> 00:13:49.920
was attacked by a vampire.

00:13:49.920 --> 00:13:52.810
What? You want revenge for 
such a distant ancestor?

00:13:52.810 --> 00:13:55.190
No, he's not so distant, actually.

00:13:55.190 --> 00:13:58.760
My great-great-great-great-grandfather
 became a vampire.

00:13:59.900 --> 00:14:00.980
So even now...

00:14:00.980 --> 00:14:03.490
Curse you, vampire!

00:14:03.490 --> 00:14:05.410
Why didn't you do this 
while I was still young?

00:14:05.410 --> 00:14:06.290
Ow...

00:14:06.290 --> 00:14:08.850
My hips... and my knees...

00:14:08.850 --> 00:14:12.450
Grandpa, I promise I'll 
defeat the vampires!

00:14:13.860 --> 00:14:17.400
It sounds like being turned when 
you're old is a lot of trouble.

00:14:18.410 --> 00:14:19.960
How do you do?

00:14:19.960 --> 00:14:22.040
I've come over since it's dark out.

00:14:22.040 --> 00:14:24.920
Oh, welcome, Ellie-chan.

00:14:24.920 --> 00:14:27.050
Oh, a young lady I've never seen before.

00:14:27.470 --> 00:14:28.690
Good evening.

00:14:28.690 --> 00:14:31.470
How boyish and yummy-looking...

00:14:31.470 --> 00:14:32.500
Yummy?

00:14:32.500 --> 00:14:34.970
Oh, an exceptionally 
beautiful girl in the yard!

00:14:34.970 --> 00:14:37.080
A beautiful girl? Where?!

00:14:38.180 --> 00:14:42.030
Ellie, actually, this is the situation...

00:14:39.810 --> 00:14:42.270
<b>Whisper</b>

00:14:40.650 --> 00:14:43.020
<b>Whisper</b>

00:14:42.030 --> 00:14:43.930
Oh, I see.

00:14:46.320 --> 00:14:49.730
Um, when I said yummy, I didn't 
mean your blood or anything.

00:14:49.730 --> 00:14:52.870
I meant it in a sexual way,
so don't take it the wrong way.

00:14:53.480 --> 00:14:55.190
That's still a no-go!

00:15:00.010 --> 00:15:02.710
Now she's even more suspicious.

00:15:02.710 --> 00:15:03.760
Oh...

00:15:05.210 --> 00:15:08.130
Let's erase her suspicion 
by eating human food.

00:15:08.130 --> 00:15:09.510
Sounds easy.

00:15:10.090 --> 00:15:12.840
Yeah, rice balls are really the best.

00:15:12.840 --> 00:15:14.700
I'll have one too, then.

00:15:14.700 --> 00:15:16.260
What is this?!

00:15:16.850 --> 00:15:18.800
It's so sticky.

00:15:18.800 --> 00:15:21.480
Ew! It's all over my hands, 
and it's not coming off!

00:15:22.700 --> 00:15:25.020
<i>I don't know when I should swallow...</i>

00:15:26.490 --> 00:15:28.410
<i>Both of them are acting so strange.</i>

00:15:28.570 --> 00:15:30.570
<b>Even more suspicious now</b>

00:15:29.410 --> 00:15:30.570
Um...

00:15:31.070 --> 00:15:33.240
Both of them are from abroad,

00:15:33.240 --> 00:15:35.580
so they're not used to Japanese food yet!

00:15:35.580 --> 00:15:38.410
Of course. The reason they 
say strange things must be

00:15:36.510 --> 00:15:40.090
Ew! It's in my hair! Someone get it out!

00:15:38.410 --> 00:15:41.040
because they're not used to Japan yet.

00:15:41.030 --> 00:15:45.840
Oh, by the way, do vampire hunters 
have special tools and stuff?

00:15:45.840 --> 00:15:46.500
Yes, we do.

00:15:46.500 --> 00:15:49.210
For instance, this hawthorn stake.

00:15:50.220 --> 00:15:54.800
And this crucifix is also supposed to do 
something when you encounter a vampire.

00:15:54.800 --> 00:15:58.800
I don't know what exactly that is, though.

00:15:59.370 --> 00:16:01.530
<i>They really don't like that.</i>

00:16:01.520 --> 00:16:04.100
Oh, you must be tired.

00:16:04.100 --> 00:16:06.480
I'll show you the spare room
 and the bathroom.

00:16:06.480 --> 00:16:07.800
Thank you so much.

00:16:09.280 --> 00:16:11.610
Should we attack her tonight?

00:16:11.610 --> 00:16:13.690
Ellie, I think we should leave for today.

00:16:14.510 --> 00:16:18.610
That human went to sleep, so there's 
nothing left to worry about.

00:16:18.610 --> 00:16:20.480
I'll watch some anime.

00:16:21.490 --> 00:16:22.560
Huh?

00:16:22.560 --> 00:16:23.630
Um...

00:16:23.630 --> 00:16:25.090
Do you need something?

00:16:26.140 --> 00:16:27.700
Sorry for disturbing you at night.

00:16:28.160 --> 00:16:29.830
I just didn't know where the toi—

00:16:30.460 --> 00:16:31.710
<i>Oh, no!</i>

00:16:32.380 --> 00:16:35.370
A coffin in your room?

00:16:35.370 --> 00:16:36.260
Could this mean...

00:16:36.920 --> 00:16:37.710
<i>This is bad.</i>

00:16:37.710 --> 00:16:40.630
It's not what you think. This is...

00:16:41.440 --> 00:16:43.520
a case for luxury body pillows!

00:16:43.520 --> 00:16:44.910
That's a thing?!

00:16:44.910 --> 00:16:47.900
We connoisseurs put the 
pillows in cases like this

00:16:47.900 --> 00:16:50.520
so they don't get dirty or crushed.

00:16:50.520 --> 00:16:54.100
I see. There's quite a lot 
of depth to your world.

00:16:55.380 --> 00:16:57.580
<i>I managed to convince her.</i>

00:16:59.560 --> 00:17:01.350
Thank you for everything.

00:17:01.350 --> 00:17:02.830
Take care.

00:17:02.830 --> 00:17:03.810
I will.

00:17:03.810 --> 00:17:05.780
I'll be going, then.

00:17:08.260 --> 00:17:10.120
Hey, you dropped this.

00:17:11.580 --> 00:17:13.670
Oh, thank you.

00:17:18.630 --> 00:17:21.520
Her hand just started to turn to ash.

00:17:21.520 --> 00:17:22.210
Don't tell me...

00:17:26.310 --> 00:17:30.730
<i>I heard that they were terrifying, 
vicious monsters.</i>

00:17:34.110 --> 00:17:36.030
You're not what I had imagined.

00:17:36.810 --> 00:17:38.620
I guess some of you are good people, too.

00:17:42.910 --> 00:17:49.040
<i>Thus the aspiring vampire hunter
left without a fight.</i>

00:17:50.440 --> 00:17:53.010
I'm so glad she understood!

00:18:59.320 --> 00:19:04.990
<b>Episode 10</b>

00:18:59.320 --> 00:19:04.990
<b>The Vampire and the End of the Year</b>

00:19:24.470 --> 00:19:26.780
That felt so good.

00:19:26.780 --> 00:19:29.470
Sophie-chan, the bath is nice and warm.

00:19:29.470 --> 00:19:32.180
Okay, I'll get in...

00:19:32.180 --> 00:19:34.900
You look so unhappy about it again.

00:19:34.900 --> 00:19:36.520
I told you before, too.

00:19:36.520 --> 00:19:39.420
I was taught that bathing 
isn't good for you.

00:19:39.420 --> 00:19:41.450
It was many centuries ago,

00:19:41.450 --> 00:19:44.620
so I do finally want to get over that, but...

00:19:46.640 --> 00:19:47.830
I have an idea!

00:19:47.830 --> 00:19:50.790
Maybe your view will change if 
we all go together and have fun.

00:19:50.790 --> 00:19:53.230
How about we go to a spa nearby?

00:19:53.230 --> 00:19:54.260
Spa?

00:19:54.260 --> 00:19:55.800
A hot spring.

00:19:57.470 --> 00:19:59.940
You don't have to if you don't want to.

00:20:00.470 --> 00:20:01.730
Hot spring?!

00:20:01.730 --> 00:20:04.290
Sounds great! Let's go! When?!

00:20:04.290 --> 00:20:05.090
Tomorrow?

00:20:05.090 --> 00:20:06.510
Don't try to call the shots!

00:20:06.510 --> 00:20:08.970
<b><i>Natural Hot Spring</i></b>

00:20:06.510 --> 00:20:08.970
I haven't been to a hot spring in a while.

00:20:08.970 --> 00:20:10.180
Same here.

00:20:08.970 --> 00:20:10.730
<b>Bath</b>

00:20:08.970 --> 00:20:10.730
<b>Bath</b>

00:20:10.180 --> 00:20:12.480
This is the first time I've
 gone to one in Japan.

00:20:12.900 --> 00:20:16.100
Well, this place does feel quite clean.

00:20:16.100 --> 00:20:18.200
Hot spring!

00:20:20.300 --> 00:20:23.940
Oh? What's wrong, Akari? 
What are you fidgeting for?

00:20:21.150 --> 00:20:23.660
<b>Fidget
Fidget</b>

00:20:21.150 --> 00:20:23.660
<b>Fidget
Fidget</b>

00:20:23.950 --> 00:20:25.870
I like going to hot springs,

00:20:25.870 --> 00:20:29.160
but getting undressed in front of 
my friends makes me self-conscious.

00:20:29.580 --> 00:20:33.590
Oh, Akari has human-like feelings, huh?

00:20:33.590 --> 00:20:34.740
That's unexpected.

00:20:34.740 --> 00:20:37.380
I'm always a very human-like human!

00:20:38.970 --> 00:20:42.100
You have no problem coming 
in when others are bathing,

00:20:42.100 --> 00:20:44.520
but you don't like being seen yourself?

00:20:44.520 --> 00:20:48.740
I-I mean, I don't have a nice figure.

00:20:49.600 --> 00:20:51.310
That's not true.

00:20:51.310 --> 00:20:52.940
You have a cute butt.

00:20:53.930 --> 00:20:55.760
Hey, Ellie! That's sexual harassment!

00:20:57.730 --> 00:21:00.830
Sophie, are you guys okay with showering?

00:21:00.830 --> 00:21:04.990
We don't like running water, but an 
amount this small isn't a big deal.

00:21:04.990 --> 00:21:06.520
Yup, this is no problem.

00:21:06.910 --> 00:21:08.270
Gotcha!

00:21:08.270 --> 00:21:11.670
<i>If you banish mundane thoughts 
from your head, even fire is cool.</i>

00:21:11.670 --> 00:21:13.860
<i>This, too, shall pass.</i>

00:21:15.490 --> 00:21:18.150
<i>It looks like some kind of training.</i>

00:21:18.150 --> 00:21:19.850
<i>Are they really okay?</i>

00:21:21.130 --> 00:21:24.140
Sophie-chan, look at all this foam.

00:21:24.140 --> 00:21:26.020
Do you want me to wash you?

00:21:26.360 --> 00:21:27.280
I'm fine.

00:21:27.280 --> 00:21:28.560
Aww!

00:21:28.560 --> 00:21:30.500
I'll let you wash me.

00:21:31.380 --> 00:21:32.730
Ellie-chan!

00:21:32.730 --> 00:21:35.690
<b>Stare</b>

00:21:35.690 --> 00:21:38.660
Ellie-chan, your skin is so smooth.

00:21:38.660 --> 00:21:40.160
Of course it is.

00:21:40.490 --> 00:21:42.230
I'm jealous.

00:21:43.070 --> 00:21:45.510
Hinata-chan, do you want me to wash you next?

00:21:45.510 --> 00:21:46.170
Huh?

00:21:46.170 --> 00:21:48.150
<i>Akari and I, washing each other?</i>

00:21:48.150 --> 00:21:49.990
That tickles!

00:21:50.860 --> 00:21:53.130
No! That's fine! I can do it myself!

00:21:53.130 --> 00:21:55.320
You sure? Too bad.

00:21:57.340 --> 00:21:59.610
<i>I got flustered and refused...</i>

00:21:59.610 --> 00:22:01.580
<i>But I'm just too embarrassed.</i>

00:22:03.930 --> 00:22:06.090
Hinata, do you also not like showers?

00:22:08.270 --> 00:22:09.610
This is heaven.

00:22:10.520 --> 00:22:12.270
This water feels so good.

00:22:12.270 --> 00:22:15.730
R-Right, it's nicer than I thought.

00:22:15.730 --> 00:22:19.850
<i>Looks like Sophie-chan isn't quite at ease.</i>

00:22:19.850 --> 00:22:24.750
I love bathing. It feels good, 
and it's good for your looks.

00:22:24.750 --> 00:22:28.790
Plus it's warm and feels like 
you're soaking in fresh blood.

00:22:29.350 --> 00:22:31.040
Don't be so creepy.

00:22:31.490 --> 00:22:33.290
Sophie-chan, are you okay?

00:22:33.290 --> 00:22:36.540
Maybe the hot spring was too much?

00:22:36.550 --> 00:22:38.130
Maybe.

00:22:38.130 --> 00:22:40.880
I can't get over my discomfort right away,

00:22:40.880 --> 00:22:44.250
but seeing how much you guys 
enjoy this makes me feel like

00:22:44.250 --> 00:22:46.090
I've grown a little fonder of baths.

00:22:47.130 --> 00:22:50.940
So I'm glad we came here today.

00:22:51.700 --> 00:22:54.910
I see. So that means we made progress, then.

00:22:54.910 --> 00:22:59.760
Yes. At this rate, I think I can 
overcome it within this century.

00:22:59.770 --> 00:23:01.480
The road ahead is so long...

00:23:04.270 --> 00:23:06.460
That was a nice bath.

00:23:06.460 --> 00:23:10.210
Was there a point in putting on the 
yukata when we're about to go home?

00:23:10.210 --> 00:23:12.980
Well, we have the opportunity. 
And they're cute.

00:23:15.220 --> 00:23:17.390
Why don't we rest here for a bit?

00:23:16.700 --> 00:23:17.910
<b>Resting Room</b>

00:23:17.900 --> 00:23:21.630
That felt so good. I love hot springs.

00:23:21.630 --> 00:23:24.630
Me, too. I never want to go home.

00:23:24.630 --> 00:23:26.460
So true.

00:23:26.460 --> 00:23:31.050
I want to soak in the bath and 
gaze at the girls forever.

00:23:31.050 --> 00:23:36.060
<b>Laze</b>

00:23:31.980 --> 00:23:34.520
<i>They all got lazy from
being in the hot water.</i>

00:23:34.520 --> 00:23:39.150
<i>Maybe baths really are wicked things
that make people depraved...</i>

00:23:36.060 --> 00:23:40.010
<b><i>Natural Hot Spring</i></b>
